WEBVTT

00:00:00.450 --> 00:00:09.570
Which dates are worth downloading? The Skåne showcase compares six filtering strategies for selecting usable satellite scenes.

00:00:10.690 --> 00:00:17.410
These historical totals combine live selection measurements with estimated spectral-download times.

00:00:18.530 --> 00:00:26.210
Mean cloud optical thickness describes the selected images. Lower values indicate less model-estimated cloud.

00:00:27.330 --> 00:00:35.010
The benchmark used an earlier weather filter. Current conditions and the updated filter need fresh evaluation.
